# aarch64 backend final audit — Dispatch Ladder, Tier 0 Gates, and Module Inventory

Logline: Static read-only audit of the AArch64 backend after this turn's growth: 33 aarch64_emit_*.oo modules plus the dispatcher, 19 dispatch arms in aarch64_emit_stream, and 3 Tier 0 gates (contract, diag, secret) plus 1 if-shape gate all wired in correct order before the chain.

Setup: Source paths are anchored at /home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA. Emit modules live under ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit*.oo. Smoke scripts live under ooda/scripts/aarch64_*_smoke.oo. Line counts come from wc -l at audit time. Header checks look for the four Academy elements (Title, Logline, Setup, Beats) as defined in openOODA/FORMAT.oot §1.1. No compiler was run. No .oo file was modified. No /tmp write occurred.

Beats:
  1. Inventory every aarch64_emit*.oo module with line count, 4-element header check, and matching smoke.
  2. Enumerate the 19 dispatch arms in aarch64_emit_stream with file:line anchors.
  3. List the 4 gate call sites (3 Tier 0 + 1 if-shape) and their order before the chain.
  4. Record any issues found during the static walk (line ceiling, missing direct smoke, naming overlap).
  5. Render a final verdict: PASS, PARTIAL, or FAIL.

File: openOODA/audit/aarch64-backend-final.oot
Status: smoke — static audit, no compilation run, no file edits
Context: Read-only verification. Dispatcher read end-to-end. All 33 aarch64_emit_*.oo files walked. All headers inspected. All smoke mirrors listed. Gate call sites mapped to file:line.

---

