## 2. Dispatch ladder arms

`aarch64_emit_stream` at ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:126–174 holds 19 arms. Each arm: `aarch64_match_<shape>(src)` runs first, on non-empty list the matching `aarch64_emit_<shape>(...)` runs and the function returns. The fallback at lines 172–173 is `a64_collect_prints(toks)` + `aarch64_emit_linux(msgs)` and is not counted as an arm.

| #  | Arm           | Match call                                | Emit call                                            | File:line                          |
|----|---------------|-------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------|
| 1  | int write     | aarch64_match_int_write(src)              | aarch64_emit_int_write(iw[0])                        | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:149     |
| 2  | alu           | aarch64_match_alu(src)                    | aarch64_emit_alu(al[0])                              | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:150     |
| 3  | float         | aarch64_match_float_test(src)             | aarch64_emit_float_test / collect_and_emit_float     | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:151–155 |
| 4  | str call      | aarch64_match_str_call(src)               | aarch64_emit_str_call(sw[0], sw[1], sw[2])           | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:156     |
| 5  | id call       | aarch64_match_id_call(src)                | aarch64_emit_id_call(ic[0], ic[1])                   | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:157     |
| 6  | match         | aarch64_match_match(src)                  | aarch64_emit_match(mm)                               | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:158     |
| 7  | while loop    | aarch64_match_while_loop(src)             | aarch64_emit_while_loop(wl)                          | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:159     |
| 8  | for           | aarch64_match_for_test(src)               | aarch64_emit_for_test(fz)                            | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:160     |
| 9  | free          | aarch64_match_free_test(src)              | aarch64_emit_free_test(fr[0], fr[1])                 | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:161     |
| 10 | heap          | aarch64_match_heap_test(src)              | aarch64_emit_heap_test()                             | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:162     |
| 11 | opt           | aarch64_match_opt(src)                    | aarch64_emit_opt_program(opt[0], opt[1])             | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:163     |
| 12 | multi main    | aarch64_match_multi_main(src)             | aarch64_emit_multi_main(m_m[0..2])                   | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:164     |
| 13 | mut local     | aarch64_match_mut_local(src)              | aarch64_emit_mut_local(ml[0], ml[1])                 | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:165     |
| 14 | fold          | aarch64_fold_hello(src)                   | aarch64_emit_linux([fold])                           | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:166     |
| 15 | struct        | aarch64_match_struct(src)                 | aarch64_emit_struct(src)                             | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:167     |
| 16 | rec           | aarch64_match_rec(src)                    | aarch64_emit_rec(rec[0..4])                          | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:168     |
| 17 | typed let     | aarch64_match_typed_let(src)              | aarch64_emit_typed_let(tl[0], tl[1])                 | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:169     |
| 18 | frame         | aarch64_match_frame_test(src)             | aarch64_emit_frame_test()                            | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:170     |
| 19 | walk          | aarch64_collect_prints(src)               | aarch64_emit_walk(wk)                                | ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit.oo:171     |

Arm 5 (id call) routes through `aarch64_match_id_call` and `aarch64_emit_id_call`, which both live in ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit_fn.oo (lines 141 and 193). The id arm counts as one arm and shares the fn module.

